#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to set Firefox as your default browser?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You want to click on a link in &kmail; and have it opened in "
"<application>Firefox</application>. At the moment, another browser is used. "
"You want to change this."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This solution will affect all of &kde;, not just &kmail;. Start "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>&systemsettings;</guimenu><guisubmenu>Default "
"Applications</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Web Browser</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Open http and https &URL;s in the following "
"browser</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>firefox</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are an administrator and want to set this setting automatically for "
"your users, it is"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"in your user directory in <filename>$(kde4-config --localprefix)/share/"
"config/kdeglobals</filename> add the line <userinput>BrowserApplication[$e]=!"
"firefox</userinput> under category <guilabel>[General]</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also use the script in <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/Special:"
"myLanguage/Tutorials/Modify_KDE_Software_Defaults\">Tutorials/"
"Modify_KDE_Software_Defaults</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to control your Roaming profile's connection?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You set up a <emphasis>Roaming profile</emphasis> to access your home server "
"while you are on the road, but it keeps trying to connect even when you are "
"at home. Auto-connection is disabled in the setup screens."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure KMail</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Accounts</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Receiving (tab)</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>(select the account to exclude)</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Retrieval Options</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, "
"uncheck <guilabel>Include in Manual Mail Check</guilabel>. This will exclude "
"the profile when you hit the download icon, but the profile will still be "
"available from the drop-down list, making it easy to get your mail while "
"away from home."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to store sent mails in a special folder?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Symptom:</emphasis> You want to store mails in a special folder. "
"Maybe you are using an &imap; server and want to store your mails on the "
"server, not in the client."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Solution:</emphasis> In &kmail;, choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure KMail</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Identities</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>(Choose an "
"identity)</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Modify</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Advanced</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Sent-mail "
"folder</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to store trash mails in a special folder?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Symptom:</emphasis> You want to store mails in a special folder. "
"Maybe you are using an &imap; server and want Trashed mails to be stored on "
"the server, not in the client."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the settings dialog select an &imap; account on the <guilabel>Accounts</"
"guilabel> page. Click on <guibutton>Modify</guibutton> and change the trash "
"folder location on the <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to store encrypted mails as unencrypted?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Symptom:</emphasis> You exchange encrypted mail with a friend, but "
"would like to store it unencrypted, once you have opened the message."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Solution:</emphasis> To store emails that have been decrypted once "
"in unencrypted format henceforth, add this to your <filename>kmail2rc</"
"filename> configuration file, in the [Reader] section:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: userinput
#: faq.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "store-displayed-messages-unencrypted=true"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This may only work with <emphasis>SMIME</emphasis> but implementation for "
"<emphasis>OpenPGP</emphasis> is being worked on."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:65
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "How do I leave messages on the server?"
msgid "How to filter spam on an &imap; server?"
msgstr "តើ​ខ្ញុំ​ត្រូវ​ចេញ​ពី​សារ​នៅលើ​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ​នេះ​បាន​យ៉ាងដូចម្តេច​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Symptom:</emphasis> You intend moving on to reading your mail from "
"an &imap; server, and wonder how filtering and spam handling will occur?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Solution:</emphasis> The machine that already has your mail can "
"become your &imap; server. You will need to configure a server application. "
"<guilabel>Dovecot</guilabel> is one such, and the guidance on the project "
"web pages make it easy to set up. That still leaves you with the problem of "
"filtering, as it makes sense to do it on the server (when you point &kmail; "
"at the server you will see the folders that you have created on the server). "
"Again there are options, but one of the best known is <guilabel>procmail</"
"guilabel>. Again there is plenty of information on the Internet on how to "
"set this up. You give it a set of <quote>recipes</quote> - here's an example:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: faq.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<markup>    :0\n"
"    * (^To|^CC|^List-ID): .*kde-linux\n"
"    ${MAILDIR}.INBOX.KDE-Lists.kde-users/\n"
"  </markup>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have <emphasis>maildir</emphasis> folders, each recipe must end with "
"a <quote>/</quote>. If your folders are <emphasis>mbox</emphasis>, just omit "
"the <quote>/</quote>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have been using <guilabel>bogofilter</guilabel> with &kmail; you will "
"already have a <emphasis>wordlist</emphasis>. This can be used at server "
"level, too, so you will not have to start training from scratch. The trick "
"is to set this before the <guilabel>procmail</guilabel> recipes:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: faq.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<markup>:0fw\n"
" | bogofilter -e -p\n"
"\n"
"0e\n"
" { EXITCODE=75 HOST }\n"
"\n"
"0:\n"
" * ^X-Bogosity: Spam, tests=bogofilter\n"
" ${MAILDIR}.INBOX.a-Spam/\n"
"\n"
"0e\n"
" { EXITCODE=75 HOST }\n"
"\n"
"0:\n"
" * ^X-Bogosity: Unsure, tests=bogofilter\n"
" ${MAILDIR}.INBOX.a-Unsure/\n"
"\n"
"0e\n"
" { EXITCODE=75 HOST }\n"
" </markup>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that it is going to use a mailbox for spam and one for unsure - I add a "
"'a-' to the name to ensure that they are easily seen, at the top of the list."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, to improve performance, run the following command occasionally on "
"saved spam and unsures:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: userinput
#: faq.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"/usr/share/bogofilter/contrib/trainbogo.sh -c -H /home/<replaceable>user</"
"replaceable>/<replaceable>Maildir</replaceable> /.INBOX.bogotrain_ham/cur/ -"
"S /home/<replaceable>user</replaceable>/<replaceable>Maildir</replaceable>/."
"INBOX.bogotrain_spam/cur/"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "(don't forget to check the path.)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is not a complete guide to setting up a server, but notes on how to set "
"up the server to work as you expect in &kmail;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to get more screen space in &kmail;?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Symptom:</emphasis> You are using &kmail; on a netbook, and find "
"that the new <emphasis>Aggregation</emphasis> display leaves you little "
"screen space"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Solution:</emphasis>If you want to change the look so that a mail "
"uses a single row instead of two rows, go to <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Message List</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Theme</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> and change the theme to <guilabel>Classic</"
"guilabel>. If you want to disable grouping by date, change the aggregation "
"using <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>Message List</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Aggregation</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to "
"<guilabel>Standard Mailing List</guilabel>. Now your &kmail; will look "
"exactly like it did in earlier versions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure KMail</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Appearance</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Fonts</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> you can select <guilabel>Use custom fonts</"
"guilabel> and change the setting for each component in the list. This is "
"when you discover that your folder list and the message bodies do use the "
"fonts you want, but the message list still has too large a font."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can make the font changes by right-clicking on the Message List headers, "
"and selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Theme</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Appearance</guimenuitem></menuchoice> tab. Each one "
"of those column headers needs to be clicked on, and your new custom font "
"set. At the end of this, the message list will display in the same font as "
"the rest of your layout."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to unconfigure &kmail; folder tool tips?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Symptom:</emphasis> You are using &kmail; on a netbook, and find "
"that the <emphasis>tooltips</emphasis> over folders hide too many folder "
"names"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Solution:</emphasis> Right-clicking on the header of the "
"<guilabel>Folder List</guilabel> and unselect <guilabel>Display Tooltips</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to unconfigure &kmail; message list tool tips?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kmail;, <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Configure "
"KMail</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Appearance</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Message "
"List</guimenuitem></menuchoice> uncheck <menuchoice><guimenu>General</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Display tooltips for messages and group headers</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to remove alternate line colourings?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In <menuchoice><guimenu>&systemsettings;</guimenu><guisubmenu>Application "
"Appearance</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Colors</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Colors</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, for each color set except <guilabel>Common "
"Colors</guilabel> (which doesn't have it), change the <guilabel>Alternate "
"Background</guilabel> to be the same as the <guilabel>Normal Background</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Mandriva</emphasis> and <emphasis>Mageia</emphasis> doesn't use "
"the name <guilabel>System Settings</guilabel>. As in <guilabel>KControl</"
"guilabel>, the KDE 3 control centre, they name it <quote>Configure your "
"Desktop</quote> to distinguish it from <quote>Configure your Computer</"
"quote>, a.k.a. the Mandriva/Mageia Control Center (MCC). Other than this "
"name change, the method is as described above."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How to transfer mail and settings to another computer (or another user "
"account on the same machine)?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Export &kmail; Data...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> to export and import settings and data. Please see "
"<ulink url=\"help:/pimsettingexporter\">PIM Setting Exporter</ulink> for "
"details."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why am I not able to copy mails to a USB stick?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Symptom:</emphasis> You are setting up a new computer and want to "
"transfer all your mail. You decide to copy everything to a USB stick. The "
"job starts, then you start to get failure message,"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: faq.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Unable to copy ............Invalid argument"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Solution:</emphasis> Your usb stick is <ulink url=\"http://wiki."
"linuxquestions.org/wiki/VFAT\">(V)FAT</ulink> formatted, and thus can't "
"handle <emphasis>maildir</emphasis> folder names (nor can it handle "
"<emphasis>permissions</emphasis>, which can cause many other problems). You "
"have two choices. Either format your <acronym>USB</acronym> stick as ext2 "
"(in which case you should be aware it can't be read on &Windows; OSes "
"without installing additional software there) or create a tar file of all "
"your mail, copy that to the stick and extract it to your new host."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why are my filters not applied to incoming messages of &imap; accounts?"
msgstr "ហេតុ​អ្វី​បានជា​តម្រង​របស់ខ្ញុំ​មិន​បានអនុវត្ត​គណនី​ imap នៃ​សារដែល​មកដល់?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Normal &imap; mode does not support filtering, but the new disconnected "
"&imap; account type does. You could try to use server-side filtering (ask "
"your admin for how to install filters on the server and in which format), "
"since &imap; is all about managing your email <emphasis>on the server</"
"emphasis>. Unfortunately, although there exists a mail filter language "
"(Sieve, defined in RFC3028), there is no standardized access protocol for "
"installing or editing server-side Sieve scripts. If such a protocol becomes "
"available in the future, &kmail; will most probably include support for it."
msgstr ""
"របៀប imap ធម្មតា​មិន​គាំទ្រ​ការ​ត្រង​ទេ ប៉ុន្តែ​ប្រភេទ​គណនី imap ដែល​ផ្ដាច់​ថ្មី​គាំទ្រ ។ អ្នក​អាច​សាកល្បង​"
"ប្រើ​តម្រង​ផ្នែក​ខាង​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ (សួរ​អ្នក​គ្រប់គ្រង​របស់​អ្នក​ពី​របៀប​ដំឡើង​តម្រង​លើ​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ និង​ក្នុង​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​"
"មួយ​ណា) ពីព្រោះ imap គឺ​អំពី​ការ​គ្រប់គ្រង​អ៊ីមែល​របស់​អ្នក <emphasis>នៅ​លើ​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ</emphasis> ។ "
"ជា​អកុសល ទោះ​បី​មាន​ភាសា​តម្រង​សំបុត្រ (Sieve បាន​បដិសេធ​ក្នុង RFC3028) គ្មាន​ពិធីការ​ចូល​ដំណើរ​ការ​"
"ស្តង់ដារ​សម្រាប់​ដំឡើង ឬ​កែ​សម្រួល​ស្គ្រីប Sieve ខាង​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ​ទេ ។ បើ​ពិធីការ​ដូច​នោះ​មាន​ក្នុង​ពេល​អនាគត "
"Kmail នឹង​រួម​បញ្ចូល​ការ​គាំទ្រ​សម្រាប់​វា​ច្រើន ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"What should I know if I want to use <application>PGP</application>/"
"<application>GnuPG</application> with &kmail;?"
msgstr ""
"បើ​ខ្ញុំ​ចង់​ប្រើ​<application>PGP</application>/<application>GnuPG</application> "
"ជាមួយ​ Kmail តើខ្ញុំ​ត្រូវ​ស្គាល់អ្វីខ្លះ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmail; provides a simple and easy-to-use interface for the basic functions "
"of these programs; still you should understand how these programs work and "
"what might make their use insecure. Some important issues:"
msgstr ""
"Kmail ផ្តល់នូវ​ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់​សាមាញ​ងាយស្រួល​ប្រើ​​មុខងារ​ជា​មូលដ្ឋាន​នៃ​កម្មវិធីទាំងនេះ អ្នកគួរតែ​ដឹង​ថាតើ​"
"កម្មវិធី​ធ្វើ​ការ​យ៉ាងដូចម្តេ​ច​ ហើយ​អ្វី​ដែលធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​អសន្តិសុខ​ ។ បញ្ហា​សំខាន់ៗ​មួយ​ចំនួន​ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You <emphasis>really</emphasis> should test if encryption works before you "
"use it. &kmail; partly relies on <application>PGP</application>/"
"<application>GnuPG</application>'s error strings, which often change between "
"different versions."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក <emphasis>ពិតជា​</emphasis>គួរតែ​សាកល្បង​​បើ​ការ​អ៊ិនគ្រីប​ធ្វើការមុន​​អ្នកប្រើវា ។​Kmail "
"ជាផ្នែក​មួយ​នៅលើ​ការកំណត់​កំហុស​របស់​ <application>PGP</application>/<application>GnuPG</"
"application>ពេលផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​រវាង​កំណែ​ជាញឹកញាប់​ ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmail; will not encrypt messages with an untrusted (unsigned) public key: "
"if you want to encrypt to such a key you should check the identity of the "
"key owner and only then sign the key with your secret key; if you do not "
"want to or cannot check the identity of the key owner but nevertheless want "
"to encrypt the message then please sign the key locally with "
"<userinput><command>gpg</command> <option>--lsign</option> "
"<replaceable>keyID</replaceable></userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Kmail នឹង​មិន​អ៊ិនគ្រីប​សារ​ដែលមាន​កូនសោសាធារណៈមិនទុកចិត្ត​ឡើយ​ (មិនទាន់ចុះហត្ថលេខា​)  ៖ បើ​អ្នកចង់​"
"អ៊ិនគ្រីប​កូនសោ​អ្នកគួរតែ​ត្រួតពិនិត្យ​អត្ថសញ្ញាណ​នៃ​ម្ចាស់សោ​ ​បាន​តែ​ចុះហត្ថលេខា​កូនសោ​ដែលមាន​សោ​សម្ងាត់​"
"របស់អ្នក បើអ្នកមិនចង់​​ត្រួតពិនិត្យ​អត្ថសញ្ញាណ​ម្ចាស់កូនសោ ​ប៉ុន្តែយ៉ាងណាក៏ដោយ​ដើម្បី​អ៊ិនគ្រីបសារ​ សូម​ចុះហត្ថលេខា​"
"កូនសោ​​មូលដ្ឋាន​ជា​មួយ  <userinput><command>gpg</command> <option>--lsign</option> "
"<replaceable>អត្ថសញ្ញាណ​កូនសោ</replaceable></userinput> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "Trusting a foreign public key without checking it is not a good idea."
msgstr "ការទុកចិត្ត​កូនសោ​សាធារណៈ​ខាងក្រៅ​ដោយ​មិន​បានត្រួតពិនិត្យ​ នេះជា​យោលបល់​មិនអាច​ទទួល​យក​បាន​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:174
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kmail; cannot encrypt and sign attachments if you are using the built-in "
#| "OpenPGP support. For encrypted and signed attachments you need to have "
#| "<link linkend=\"configure-security-crypto-backends\">crypto plugins</"
#| "link> installed and configured."
msgid ""
"&kmail; cannot encrypt and sign attachments if you are using the built-in "
"OpenPGP support. For encrypted and signed attachments you need to have "
"crypto plugins installed and configured."
msgstr ""
"Kmail មិនអាច​អ៊ិនគ្រីប​ ហើ​យចុះហត្ថលេខា​ឯកសារភ្ជាប់​ បើអ្នកកំពុង​ប្រើ​​OpenPGP ជាប់ ។ ចំពោះ​ឯកសារភ្ជាប់​"
"ដែលបានចុះហត្ថលេខា និង​អ៊ិនគ្រីប​ត្រូវ​តែ​បាន​ <link linkend=\"configure-security-crypto-"
"backends\">ដំឡើង និង​កំណត់​រចនាសមព័ន្ធ​</link> កម្មវិធីជំនួយ crypto ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starting with GnuPG 1.0.7 you have to set your own key to ultimate "
"ownertrust: it is no longer implicitly done for you."
msgstr ""
"កំពុង​ចាប់ផ្តើម​​ GnuPG ១.០.៧ ដែលអ្នកបានកំណត់​កូនសោ​ផ្ទាល់​របស់អ្នក​ដើម្បីទុកចិត្ត​ដល់ទីបំផុត ៖វា​គ្មាន​អ្វី​ដែល​"
"មិនច្បាស់​ធ្វើរួច​ទៀត​ឡើយ​សម្រាប់អ្នក ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where does &kmail; save my settings and my mail?"
msgstr "តើ​​ Kmail រក្សាទុកការកំណត់​ និង​សំបុត្រ​របស់ខ្ញុំ​នៅទីតាំង​ណា?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most &kmail; settings are stored in <filename>$(kde4-config --localprefix)/"
"share/config/kmail2rc</filename> and the <emphasis>Akonadi</emphasis>-"
"controlled entries are stored in the following folders and files:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: filename
#: faq.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "~/.local/share/"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:194
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kmail; does not lock the files in <filename class=\"directory\">~/Mail</"
#| "filename>."
msgid "<filename class=\"directory\">~/.config/akonadi/</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Kmail មិនចាក់សោ​​ឯកសារនៅក្នុង​ថត​ <filename class=\"directory\">~/Mail</filename> "
"ឡើយ ។​"

#. Tag: filename
#: faq.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "$(kde4-config --localprefix)/share/config/nepomukserverrc"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">$(kde4-config --localprefix)/share/apps/"
"nepomuk/</filename> (&kaddressbook; stores contact groups in "
"<emphasis>Nepomuk</emphasis>.)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that some of the files are hidden: remember to also copy those if you "
"want to backup or archive your mails."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why did &kmail; regenerate the index of a folder?"
msgstr "តើហេតុអ្វី​បានជា​ Kmail បង្កើត​ថត​លិបិក្រមឡើងវិញ​​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmail; regenerates the index of a folder whenever the index appears to be "
"out of date, &ie; whenever the contents of a folder are newer than the "
"index. &kmail; regenerates the index in this case in order to prevent the "
"loss or corruption of messages. Unfortunately, currently-deleted messages "
"might reappear and message flags (like important, etc.) might be lost when "
"the index is regenerated."
msgstr ""
"Kmail បង្កើត​ថត​លិបិក្រម​​ឡើងវិញពេល​​លិបិក្រមដែល​​លេចឡើងហួសសម័យ​ឧទាហរណ៍ ពេល​មាតិកា​ថត​ថ្មីជាង​លិបិក្រម​​ ។​ "
"Kmail បង្កើត​លិបិក្រម​ឡើង​វិញ​ក្នុង​ករណី​នេះ​គឺ​ដើម្បីការពារ​ការបាត់បង់ ឬខូចសារ​​ ។ ជាអកុសល​សារ​ដែលលុប​"
"បច្ចុប្បន្ន​​អាចនឹង​លេចឡើង​ម្តងទៀត ហើយទង់សារ​ (សំខាន់ ។ល។) អាចនឹង​បាត់បង់​ពេល​លិបិក្រម​បង្កើត​ឡើងវិញ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An outdated index can have several causes; the two most important causes are:"
msgstr "លិបិក្រម​ដែលហួសសម័យ​អាច​បណ្តាល​មកពី​ច្រើនករណី ពីរករណី​ជា​មូលហេតុ​ដែល​សំខាន់ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some other program modified the contents of the folder: if you want to use "
"&kmail; together with procmail then please read <link linkend=\"faq-procmail"
"\">this &FAQ;</link>. If you want to use &kmail; together with another email "
"client then please read <link linkend=\"faq-other-muas\">this &FAQ;</link>."
msgstr ""
"កម្មវិធីមួយ​ចំនួនផ្សេងទៀត​ត្រូវបាន​កែសម្រួល​មាតិកា​ថត​​​ ៖បើអ្នកចង់ប្រើ​Kmail ជាមួយ​ procmail សូម​អាន​ "
"<link linkend=\"faq-procmail\">សំណួរចម្លើយ​នេះ  </link>​ ។ បើអ្ន​ក​ចង់​ប្រើ​ Kmail ជាមួយ​"
"កម្មវិធី​អ៊ីមែល​ផ្សេងទៀត​សូម​អាន​<link linkend=\"faq-other-muas\">សំណួរចម្លើយ​នេះ</link> "

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:221
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If your mail folder (usually <filename class=\"directory\">"
#| "$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/apps/kmail/</filename> or <filename class="
#| "\"directory\">~/Mail</filename>) is on a volume which is mounted via NFS "
#| "and if the clock of the NFS server is ahead of the clock of your computer "
#| "then the NFS server sometimes reports a wrong file date for the index "
#| "file. In this case &kmail; assumes that the index is outdated although in "
#| "reality it is not. To fix this problem you (or your system administrator) "
#| "have to make sure that the clock of the NFS server and the clock of your "
#| "computer are always in sync. One way to achieve this is the use of the "
#| "ntp daemon."
msgid ""
"If your mail folder is on a volume which is mounted via NFS and if the clock "
"of the NFS server is ahead of the clock of your computer then the NFS server "
"sometimes reports a wrong file date for the index file. In this case &kmail; "
"assumes that the index is outdated although in reality it is not. To fix "
"this problem you (or your system administrator) have to make sure that the "
"clock of the NFS server and the clock of your computer are always in sync. "
"One way to achieve this is the use of the ntp daemon."
msgstr ""
"បើ​ថត​សំបុត្រ​របស់អ្នក​ (ជាធម្មតា​ <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEHOME</"
"envar>/share/apps/kmail/</filename> ឬ <filename class=\"directory\">~/Mail</"
"filename>) ស្ថិតនៅលើ​ភាគ​ដែលបានម៉ោន​វា​តាម​រយៈ NFS ហើយ​បើពេលវេលា​នៃ​ម៉ាស៊ីន បម្រើ​ NFS យក​"
"ពេលវេលា​នៃ​កុំព្យួទ័រ​របស់អ្នក​ ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ​ NFS រាយការណ៍​កាលបរិច្ឆេទ​ឯកសារ ​ខុសៗសម្រាប់​ឯកសារ​លិបិក្រម​ ។ "
"នៅក្នុង​ករណី​នេះ Kmail សម្មត​ថា​លិបិក្រម​​​ហួសសម័យ​ទៅហើយ​ ។ដើម្បីជួសជុល​បញ្ហា​នេះ អ្នក​ (ឬ​អ្នកគ្រប់គ្រង​ប្រព័ន្ធ​"
"របស់អ្នក) ឲ្យ​ប្រាកដ​ថា​ពពេលវេលា​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ​NFS និង​ពេលវេលា​នៃ​កុំព្យួទ័រ​របស់អ្នក​ធ្វើសម្មកាលកម្ម​ជានិច្ច​ "
"។ វិធីមួយ​ទៀត​គឺប្រើ​ដេមិន​ ntp ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why does &kmail; not start up?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Symptom:</emphasis> You want to start &kmail; from a minimal "
"desktop environment like <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Fvwm2\">fvwm2</ulink>. It does not start."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Reason:</emphasis> You are missing the <emphasis>dbus</emphasis> "
"functionality."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Solution:</emphasis> Start &kmail; using dbus-launch like this:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: userinput
#: faq.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "dbus-launch kmail"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Can I use &kmail; together with a different email client, &eg; "
"<application>mutt</application>?"
msgstr ""
"តើ​ខ្ញុំ​អាច​ប្រើ​ Kmail ដែលមាន​កម្មវិធីអ៊ីមែល​ខុសៗគ្នា​ ឧទាហរណ៍<application>mutt</application> "
"បាន​ដែរ​ឬទេ​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you're using the mbox format for your folders it is not possible to use a "
"different email client while &kmail; is running. With <application>mutt</"
"application> there may also be problems even if both programs are not "
"running at the same time. We recommend to use the maildir format in this "
"case, this should solve all problems."
msgstr ""
"បើអ្នកកំពុងប្រើ​ជាទ្រង់ទ្រាយថត​ mbox ​អ្នកមិនអាច​​ប្រើ​កម្មវិធីអ៊ីមែលផ្សេងគ្នា​​ពេល​Kmail កំពុង​រត់ឡើង ។ "
"ជាមួយ​ <application>mutt</application> វា​ប្រហែលជា​មាន​បញ្ហាច្រើន​​សូម្បីតែ​កម្មវិធីទាំងពីរ​មិនអាច​"
"រត់​ក្នុង​ពេលតែមួយ​បានឡើយ ។ ក្នុងករណីនេះ​យើង​សូម​ផ្តល់អនុសាសន៍​ប្រើ ​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ maildir ហើយ​បញ្ហាញ​ទាំងអស់​"
"គួរតែ​បាន​ដោះស្រាយ​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "How can I convert my mailboxes from mbox to maildir?"
msgstr "តើខ្ញុំ​អាច​បម្លែង​ប្រអប់សំបុត្រ​របស់ខ្ញុំ​ពី​  mbox ទៅ​ maildir បានយ៉ាងដូចម្តេច​ដែរ​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is no automatic way to do that. You will have to create a new folder "
"in maildir format and copy the messages from the mbox folder into this new "
"folder. Remember to adapt any filter rules connected with the old folder "
"before you delete it."
msgstr ""
"គ្មាន​វិធីបង្កើត​​វា​ដោយ​ស្វ័យ​ប្រវត្តិ​ឡើយ ។ អ្នក​ត្រូវ​បង្កើត​ថត​ថ្មី​ជាទ្រង់ទ្រាយmaildir ហើយ​ចម្លង​សារ​ពី​ថត​​ "
"mbox ទៅ​ថត​ថ្មីនេះ ។ ចំណាំថា​​ត្រូវ​សម្រួល​ច្បាប់តម្រង​ដែលបាន​តភ្ជាប់​ជាមួយ​ថត​ចាស់ៗ​មុនអ្នកលុបវាចោល​​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How can I remove attachments from messages without removing the message "
"itself?"
msgstr "តើ​ខ្ញុំ​អាច​យក​ឯកសារ​ភ្ជាប់​ចេញពីសារ​ដោយ​មិន​យក​សារ​ផ្ទាល់​របស់វា​ចេញ​យ៉ាង​ដូចម្តេច​ដែរ ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the context menu with a &RMB; click on an attachment and select "
"<guimenuitem>Delete Attachment</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid "How can I make &kmail; check for new messages at startup?"
msgstr "តើខ្ញុំ​អាចត្រួតពិនិត្យ​​ Kmail សម្រាប់សារថ្មី​ពេលចាប់ផ្តើម​យ៉ាងដូចម្តេច​ដែរ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If &kmail; should always check for new messages at startup then enable "
"<guilabel>Check mail on startup</guilabel> on the <link linkend=\"configure-"
"accounts-receiving\">Accounts configuration page</link>. Otherwise start "
"&kmail; with <command>kmail <option>--check</option></command>."
msgstr ""
"បើ​ Kmail ត្រួតពិនិត្យ​សារ​ថ្មី​ពេលចាប់ផ្តើម​ជានិច្ច​ បើក​<guilabel>ត្រួតពិនិត្យសំបុត្រ​ពេលចាប់ផ្តើម​</"
"guilabel> នៅក្នុង​ទំព័រ​<link linkend=\"configure-accounts-receiving"
"\">ការកំណត់រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​គណនី</link>។ មិនដូច្នេះទេ​ចាប់ផ្តើម​ Kmail ជាមួយ​ <command>kmail "
"<option>--check</option></command>."

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I get a list of changes between the versions of &kmail;?"
msgstr "តើខ្ញុំ​អាច​ទទួល​បាន​បញ្ជី​ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​រវាង​​កំណែ Kmail នៅទីកន្លែង​ណា​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The welcome screen lists all important changes for your version. It is "
"displayed when you select <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>&kmail; Introduction</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"អេក្រង់ស្វាគមន៍​រាយ​បញ្ជី​ការផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​កំណែរ​សំខាន់ៗ​របស់អ្នក ។ វា​បាន​បង្ហាញពេល​ជ្រើស​ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>ជំនួយ​</guimenu><guimenuitem>ការណែនាំ​ពី Kmail </"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I'm one of those people whose mails consist of 100 quoted lines and one line "
"written by myself. For some reason this annoys other people. Can &kmail; "
"help me and make everyone's life better?"
msgstr ""
"ខ្ញុំជា​អ្នកប្រើម្នាក់​ក្នុង​ចំណោម​មនុស្ស​ទាំង​នោះ សំបុត្រ​មាន​បន្ទាត់​​ដែល​ដកស្រង់​ចំនួន​ ១០០ ហើយ​​បន្ទាប់​នីមួយៗ​​ត្រូវ​"
"បានសរសេ​រ​ដោយ​ខ្លួន​ឯង​ ។ ហេតផលគឺា​នេះជា​ការរំខានអ្នកដទៃ។ តើ​ Kmail អាច​ជួយ​ខ្ុំ ហើយ​ះ​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​"
"នណាម្នាក់​ប្រសើរឡើយ​បាន​ដែរឬទេ​​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sure. Just select a short relevant part of the original mail with the mouse "
"before you reply. Only this part will then be quoted in your reply."
msgstr ""
"ពិតជាបាន​ គ្រាន់តែជ្រើស​ផ្នែកដែលទាក់ទង​នៃ​សំបុត្រ​ដើម​ដោយ​ប្រើកណ្តុរ​មុនអ្នកឆ្លើយតប​ ។ មានតែ​ផ្នែក​នេះ​ទេ​"
"នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​ដកស្រង់​ការឆ្លើយតប​របស់អ្នក ។ "

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For some messages the value in the <guilabel>Date</guilabel> field is "
"<guilabel>unknown</guilabel> or it is not correct."
msgstr ""
"ចំពោះសារ​ផ្សេងៗ​ដែលមាន​តម្លៃក្នុង​វាល​ <guilabel>កាលបរិច្ឆេទ​</guilabel> គឺ​<guilabel>មិនស្គាល់​"
"</guilabel> ឬ​វា​មិន​ត្រឹមត្រូវ​​​​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Probably the <quote>Date:</quote> header of these messages is broken and "
"&kmail; cannot interpret it. That is not a bug in &kmail; but in the "
"software that sent the mail."
msgstr ""
"​បឋមកថា​ <quote>កាលបរិច្ឆេទ ៖</quote>នៃ​សារ​ទាំងនេះ​អាចនឹង​ខូច​ ហើយ​Kmail មិនអាច​បកប្រែ​"
"វាបានឡើយ ។ នេះមិនមែនជា​កំហុស​ក្នុង​ Kmail ទេ ប៉ុន្តែ​កំហុសក្នុង​កម្មវិធី​ផ្ញើ សំបុត្រ​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid "My signature has two dashes above it. What's up?"
msgstr "ការចុះហត្ថលេខា​របស់ខ្ញុំ​មានបន្ទាត់ដាច់ៗ​នៅពីលើ​វា​ចំនួន​ពីរ ។ តើត្រូវ​ធ្វើ​វា​យ៉ាងម្តេច​ទៅ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Separating the signature from the message body with two dashes and a space "
"on a single line is common usage. These symbols permit mail clients who "
"recognize them to trim the signatures from a reply. If your signature does "
"not already have this separator, &kmail; will automatically add it."
msgstr ""
"ការបំបែក​ហត្ថលេខា​ពី​តួសារ​​ដែលមាន​បន្ទាត់ដាច់ៗ​ចំនួន​ពីរ​ និង​​ចន្លោះមើល​មិនឃើញ​​នៅលើ​បន្ទាត់​តែ​មួយ​"
"ប្រើប្រាស់យ៉ាងសាមាញ​ ។ និម្មិតសញ្ញាណ​ទាំងនេះ​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យកម្មវិធីអ៊ីមែល​​រៀបចំពួកវាដោយ​កាត់តម្រឹម​​ហត្ថលេខា​ពី​"
"ការឆ្លើយតប​​ ។ បើ​ការចុះហត្ថលេខា​របស់អ្នក​មិនទាន់​បំបែកទេ Kmail នឹង​បន្ថែម​វា​ដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid "Are there any known bugs in &kmail;?"
msgstr "តើមានកំហុស​អ្វីខ្លះ​នៅក្នុង​ Kmail?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:324
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "A list of submitted bugs is linked at <ulink url=\"http://kmail.kde.org/"
#| "\">the &kmail; homepage</ulink>. Note that not all these bugs are valid. "
#| "All in all we think that &kmail; is a very robust piece of software."
msgid ""
"A list of submitted bugs can be obtained by the query from the <ulink url="
"\"https://bugs.kde.org/buglist.cgi?quicksearch=kmail2\">Bugzilla page</"
"ulink>. Note that not all these bugs are valid. All in all we think that "
"&kmail; is a very robust piece of software."
msgstr ""
"បញ្ជីស្នើ​កំហុស​​បានតទៅ <ulink url=\"http://kmail.kde.org/\">គេហទំព័រ​ Kmail </ulink> ។ "
"ចំណាំថា​កំហុស​ទាំងអស់​នេះ​ត្រឹមត្រូវ​នោះទេ​ ។​យើងគិតថា​ Kmail ជាកម្មវិធីមួយ​ដ៏រឹងមាំង ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:328
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "However, you should not run &kmail; while another email client is already "
#| "accessing the files in <filename class=\"directory\">~/Mail</filename>; "
#| "if you try to do so, you might lose messages. Note that you should make "
#| "backups of your messages anyway."
msgid ""
"However, you should not run &kmail; while another email client is already "
"accessing the files in the mail directory; if you try to do so, you might "
"lose messages. Note that you should make backups of your messages anyway."
msgstr ""
"អ្នកមិនគួរ​រត់​ Kmail ពេល​កម្មវិធីអ៊ីមែល​ផ្សេងកំពុង​ចូល​ដំណើរការ​ក្នុង​ <filename class=\"directory"
"\">~/Mail</filename>ឡើយ បើអ្នកព្យាយាមធ្វើដូចនេះ​ អ្នកអាច​នឹង​បាត់បង់សារ​ ។ ចំណាំថា​អ្នកគួរតែ​"
"បង្កើត​​ព័ត៌មាន​បម្រុងទុកសា​ររបស់អ្នក ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:335
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&kmail; does not display <acronym>HTML</acronym> mail properly."
msgid "&kmail; does not display &HTML; mail properly."
msgstr "Kmail មិន​បង្ហាញ​សំបុត្រ​  <acronym>HTML</acronym> បានត្រឹមត្រូវ​ឡើយ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:336
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "References to external content like images, are disabled by default, as "
#| "they can be used to track whether and when you read a message. Loading "
#| "external references can be activated in the <guilabel>Security</guilabel> "
#| "tab in &kmail;'s configuration dialog; also Plugins (like <trademark "
#| "class=\"registered\">Macromedia</trademark> <application>Flash</"
#| "application>), &Java; and JavaScript will not be displayed in &kmail; for "
#| "security reasons and there is no way to activate them."
msgid ""
"References to external content like images, are disabled by default, as they "
"can be used to track whether and when you read a message. Loading external "
"references can be activated in the <guilabel>Security</guilabel> tab in "
"&kmail;'s configuration dialog; also Plugins (like <trademark class="
"\"registered\">Adobe</trademark> <application>Flash</application>), &Java; "
"and JavaScript will not be displayed in &kmail; for security reasons and "
"there is no way to activate them."
msgstr ""
"តាម​លំនាំដើម​សេចក្តីយោង​មាតិកាខាងក្រៅ​​ជា​រូបភាពមិនត្រូវ​បាន​អនុញ្ញាត​ទេ​ ពួក​វា​ប្រើ​សម្រាប់តាមដាន​"
"ពេលអ្នកអាន​សារ​ ។ ​ផ្ទុក​សេចក្តីយោង​ខាងក្រៅ​​អាច​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​សកម្មក្នុង​ផ្ទាំង​ <guilabel>សុវត្ថិភាព​</"
"guilabel> ក្នុង​ប្រអប់ការកំណត់រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​របស់ Kmail ​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ  (ដូចជា​ <trademark class="
"\"registered\">Macromedia</trademark> <application>Flash</application>), "
"&Java; និង​ JavaScript សុវត្ថិភាព​មិនបង្ហាញ​នៅក្នុង​ Kmail  ហើយ​ក៏គ្មាន​វិធី​ធ្វើឲ្យ​ពួកវា​ទាន់សម័យ​"
"ផងដែរ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Can I use two different versions of &kmail; at the same time? Can I go back "
"from a current version of &kmail; to an older one?"
msgstr ""
"តើ​ខ្ញុំអាច​ប្រើកំណែ Kmail ពីរខុសគ្នា​ក្នុង​ពេលតែមួយ​បានទេ​? តើខ្ញុះអាច​ត្រឡប់ទៅ​កំណែបច្ចុប្បន្ន​នៃ​ Kmail "
"ដើម្បីបញ្ជា​វា​បានដែរឬទេ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:348
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can only run one instance of &kmail; at once. We also recommend to "
#| "stick to a certain version and not switch back and forth between "
#| "different versions. Downgrading to an older version will probably cause "
#| "problems, &eg; because the index file formats might have changed. "
#| "Upgrading should never be a problem."
msgid ""
"You can only run one instance of &kmail; at a time. We also recommend to "
"stick to a certain version and not switch back and forth between different "
"versions. Downgrading to an older version will probably cause problems, &eg; "
"because the index file formats might have changed. Upgrading should never be "
"a problem."
msgstr ""
"អ្នកអាច​រត់ជំនួស​ Kmail បានតែ​ម្តង​ប៉ុណ្ណោះ ។ យើង​ផ្តល់អនុសាសន៍បិទ​កំណែរ ហើយ​មិនប្តូរ​ត្រឡប់​ទៅ​កំណែទីបួន​"
"ខុសៗគ្នា​ឡើយ ។ ការទាញយក​កំណែចាស់ជាង​​ប្រហែលជា​អាចធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​មាន​បញ្ហា​កើតឡើង ព្រោះ​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ឯកសារ​"
"លិបិក្រម​​ត្រូវ​បានផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​ ។ ការធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ទាន់សម័យ​​មិនដែល​ជួ​បនូវ​បញ្ហា​ទេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "Does &kmail; support uuencoded files?"
msgstr "តើ​ Kmail គាំទ្រ​ឯកសារ uuencoded ដែរឬទេ​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Uuencoded attachments are not supported. Save your mail with an uuencoded "
"attachment and use <command>uudecode</command> to decode the attachment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:361
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kmail; crashed while I was writing a mail; is that mail is lost now?"
msgid "&kmail; crashed while I was writing a mail; is that mail lost now?"
msgstr "Kmail បានគាំ​ពេល​ខ្ញុំ​កំពុង​សរសេរសំបុត្រ​ តើឥឡូវ​នេះ​អាចបាត់បង់សំបុត្រ​ដែរឬទេ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:362
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kmail; tries to save your mail to <filename>~/dead.letter</filename> in "
#| "case of a crash. The next time you start &kmail; the mail composer should "
#| "appear with your mail again; If it does not, try to open <filename>~/dead."
#| "letter</filename> with an editor. If it does not exist then the crash was "
#| "so bad that &kmail; could not save your mail."
msgid ""
"&kmail; tries to save your mail to <filename class=\"directory\">$(kde4-"
"config --localprefix)/share/apps/kmail/autosave</filename> in case of a "
"crash. The next time you start &kmail; the mail composer should appear with "
"your mail again; If it does not, try to open the files in <filename class="
"\"directory\">$(kde4-config --localprefix)/share/apps/kmail/autosave</"
"filename> with an editor. If there are no files in this folder then the "
"crash was so bad that &kmail; could not save your mail."
msgstr ""
"Kmail ព្យាយាម​រក្សាទុក​សំបុត្រ​របស់អ្នកទៅ​ <filename>~/dead.letter</filename> ក្នុងករណី​​គាំង​ ។"
"ពេល​អ្នកចាប់ផ្តើម Kmail លើក​ក្រោយ​​កម្មវិធីតែង​សំបុត្រ​នឹង​លេចឡើង​​ជាមួយសំបុត្រ​របស់អ្នកម្តង​ទៀត បើវា​"
"មិនលេចឡើង ព្យាយាម​បើក <filename>~/dead.letter</filename> ក្នុងកម្មវិធីនិពន្ធ​ ។ បើវា​"
"គ្មានម្មវិធីនិពន្ធទេ ការគាំង​នឹង​ធ្ងន់ធ្ងរ​ដែល​ Kmail មិនអាច​រក្សាទុក​សំបុត្រ​របស់អ្នកបានឡើយ ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When I try to set a folder to be mailing list-aware, it does not do anything "
"when receiving an email from the list."
msgstr "ពេល​ខ្ញុំ​ព្យាយាម​កំណត់​ថត​ទៅ​បញ្ជីសំបុត្រ​ វាមិនធ្វើ​អ្វីទាំងអស់​ពេល​កំពុង​ទទួលអ៊ីមែល​ពី​បញ្ជី ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Associating a folder with a mailing list has nothing to do with filtering "
"the mailing list messages &mdash; you have to add a new filter rule "
"manually; however, once you associated a folder with a mailing list you can "
"use <menuchoice> <guimenu>Message</guimenu><guimenuitem>Reply to Mailing-"
"List...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or <menuchoice><guimenu>Message</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>New Message to Mailing-List...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> and the mailing list address will be set in the <guilabel>To:</"
"guilabel> field."
msgstr ""
"ការតភ្ជាប់​ថត​ជាមួយ​បញ្ជី​សំបុត្រ​​គ្មាន​ការត្រង​​បញ្ជីសំបុត្រ​សារ​​ mdash អ្នកអាច​បន្ថែម​ច្បាប់តម្រង​ថ្មី​​ដោយដៃ "
"ទោះជាអ្នក​​បាន​ភ្ជាប់​ថត​ជាមួយ​បញ្ជីសំបុត្រ​​រួម​ក៏ដោយ​ ក៏អ្នកអាច​ប្រើ​<menuchoice> <guimenu>សារ</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>ឆ្លើយតប​ទៅ​បញ្ជីសំបុត្រ​រួម​...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>សារ​</guimenu><guimenuitem>សារថ្មីទៅ​បញ្ជីសំបុត្ររួម​​...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ហើយ​បញ្ជីសំបុត្រ​រួម​នឹង​កំណត់ក្នុង​វាល <guilabel>ទៅ ៖</guilabel> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:380
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "My SMTP server requires authentication; Does &kmail; support this?"
msgid "My SMTP server requires authentication; does &kmail; support this?"
msgstr "ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ​ SMTP ទាមទា​ការផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់ភាពត្រឹមត្រូវ​ តើ​ Kmail គាំទ្រ​ការផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់នេះទេ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Authentication</guilabel> can be set in the "
"<guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab of the SMTP configuration dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use &kmail; and <application>procmail</application>?"
msgstr "តើ​ខ្ញុំ​អាច​ប្រើ​​ Kmail និង​ <application>procmail</application>​បានដែរ​ឬទេ​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes, but it is important to do it the right way or you might lose mail. In "
"order to use <application>procmail</application> and &kmail; you need to set "
"up &kmail; so that it will fetch new mail from the spoolfiles in which "
"<application>procmail</application> drops your mail. Do <emphasis>not</"
"emphasis> set up procmail to deliver mail in a &kmail; folder, this cannot "
"work."
msgstr ""
"ចាស/បាទ ប៉ុន្តែ​វាសំខាន់ដែល​ត្រូវ​ធ្វើ​ ឬ​អ្នកអាច​នឹង​បាត់បង់​សំបុត្រ​​ ។ ក្នុង​គោល​បំណង​ប្រើ​ "
"<application>procmail</application> និង Kmail អ្នកត្រូវការ​រៀបចំ​Kmail ដូច្នេះ​វា​"
"នឹងទៅប្រមូល​យក​សំបុត្រ​ថ្មី​ពី​ឯកសារ​ស្នូល​ហើយ​ទម្លាក់​ក្នុង​<application>procmail</application>សំបុត្រ​"
"របស់អ្នក ។ កុំ <emphasis>រៀបចំ</emphasis> ​procmail ដើម្បី​បញ្ចូន​សំបុត្រ​ក្នុង​ថត​​ Kmail វា​មិនធ្វើ​"
"ការ​ទេ​ ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:395
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each procmail spoolfile you then need to create an account from which "
"&kmail; will fetch new mail; you also need to make sure you specify the "
"right lockfile name for this account. When setting up an account, &kmail; "
"will do some minimal parsing on your <filename>.procmail</filename> file, "
"and will try to list every spoolfile it has found, and also the lockfiles "
"next to the <guilabel>procmail lockfile</guilabel> item. procmail lets the "
"user specify lockfiles in three different ways, so there is no way to "
"establish a correspondence between the spoolfiles and lockfiles; so it's "
"really up to you to make sure you specify the right lockfile for each "
"spoolfile."
msgstr ""
"ឯកសារ​ស្នូល​ procmail នីមួយៗ​ត្រូវការ​បង្កើត​គណនី​ដើម្បី​ឲ្យ​ ​Kmail នឹង​ទៅ​ប្រមូល​យក​សំបុត្រ​ថ្មី សូម​ឲ្យ​ប្រាកដថា​"
"អ្នក​បញ្ជាក់ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារជាប់សោ​​ត្រឹមត្រូវ​សម្រាប់គណនីនេះរួចហើយ​។ ពេលកំពុង​រៀបចំ​គណនី​ Kmail នឹង​ញែក​អតិបរមា​​"
"នៅលើ​ឯកសារ​<filename>.procmail</filename> ហើយ​ព្យាយាម​រាយបញ្ជី​គ្រប់ឯកសារ​ស្នូល​ដែលវា​រក​ឃើញ​ "
"និ​ង​ឯកសារ​ជាប់សោ​បន្ទាប់ពី​ធាតុ​ឯកសារជាប់សោ​ <guilabel>procmail</guilabel> ។ procmail "
"អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នកប្រើបញ្ជាក់​ឯកសារ​ជាប់សោ​​តាម​បីរបៀប​ខុសៗគ្នា​ ដូច្នេះ​វា​គ្មានវិធី​សម្រាប់​បង្កើត​​ការឆ្លើយឆ្លង​"
"រវាង​ឯកសារស្នូល​ និង​ឯកសារជាប់សោ​។ ដូច្នេះ​អ្នកអាច​ធ្វើតាម​ចិត្ត​​តែ​ឲ្យ​ប្រាកដថា​អ្នក​បាន បញ្ជាក់​​ឯកសារ​"
"ជាប់សោត្រឹមត្រូវ​​សម្រាប់​ឯកសារ​ស្នូលនីមួយៗ​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid "Spellchecking does not recognize non-English characters."
msgstr "ពិនិត្យ​​អក្ខរាវិរុទ្ធSpellchecking does not recognize non-English characters."

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:412
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Before you can use spellchecking the first time, you have to configure "
#| "it. You can do so in the composer window's menu under "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Spellchecker...</"
#| "guimenuitem></menuchoice>. You can set the dictionary and the encoding "
#| "there."
msgid ""
"Before you can use spellchecking the first time, you have to configure it. "
"You can do so in the composer window's menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Spellchecker...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. You can set the dictionary there."
msgstr ""
"មុនអ្នកអាចប្រើ​ការត្រួតពិនិត្យ​អក្ខរាវិរុទ្ធ​គ្រាដំបូង​ អ្នក​ត្រូវ​កំណត់រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​វា​ជាមុន​ ។ អ្នកអាច​"
"ធ្វើដូច្នេះ​បាននៅក្នុង​ម៉ឺនុយ​បង្អួច​កម្មវិធីតែង​ក្រោម​ <menuchoice><guimenu>ការកំណត់​</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>ពិនិត្យ​អក្ខរាវិរុទ្ធ​...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>។ អ្នកកំណត់​វចនានុក្រម​ហើយ​​"
"អ៊ិនកូដ​នៅទៅនេះ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How do I use my <application>Eudora</application>/&Netscape;/"
"<application>Outlook</application>/... mail folders in &kmail;?"
msgstr ""
"តើ​ខ្ញុំ​ប្រើ​ថតសំបុត្រ​<application>Eudora</application>/&Netscape;/"
"<application>Outlook</application>/... ក្នុង​ Kmail របស់​ខ្ញុំ​យ៉ាងដូចម្តេច​ទៅ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:423
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "See the section <link linkend=\"importing\">Using other Mailbox files "
#| "With &kmail;</link>."
msgid ""
"See the section <link linkend=\"importing-options\">Importing in &kmail;</"
"link>."
msgstr ""
"សូមមើល​ភាគ​ <link linkend=\"importing\">ប្រើប្រាស់​ឯកសារ​ប្រអប់សំបុត្រ​ផ្សេង​ជាមួយKmail </"
"link> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Can I use encryption with my normal (non-<acronym>SSL</acronym>) POP3 "
"account?"
msgstr ""
"តើខ្ញុំ​អាច​ប្រើ​ការអ៊ិនគ្រីប​ជាមួយ​គណនី (គ្មាន​-<acronym>SSL</acronym>) POP3 ធម្មតា​បាន​ទេ​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your POP3 server runs an <application>ssh</application> daemon, you can "
"use ssh to tunnel your POP3 connection using the following command:"
msgstr ""
"បើ​ម៉ាស៊ីនបម្រើ​ POP3 របស់អ្នករត់​ដេមិន​ <application>ssh</application> អ្នកអាច​ប្រើ​ ssh "
"សម្រាប់ការតភ្ជាប់​​ធ្យូនែល POP3 របស់អ្នក​ប្រើ​ពាក្យបញ្ជាដូច​តទៅនេះ ៖"

#. Tag: userinput
#: faq.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>ssh</command> <option>-L 11000:127.0.0.1:110 user@host</option>"
msgstr ""
"<command>ssh</command> <option>-L ១១០០០:១២៧.០.០.១:១១០ user@host</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Modify your &kmail; configuration to fetch the mail via POP3 from "
"<userinput>localhost</userinput> and ssh will tunnel the connection for you."
msgstr ""
"កែប្រែ​ការកំណត់រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​ Kmail របស់អ្នក​ដើម្បីទៅប្រមូលយក​សំបុត្រ​តាម​រយៈ POP3 ពី​ "
"<userinput>localhost</userinput> និង​​ ssh នឹង​តភ្ជាប់​​ធ្យូនែលសម្រាប់អ្នក ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If non-encrypted messages have already been sent via Internet, the only "
"advantage of using <application>ssh</application> is that your "
"<emphasis>password</emphasis> will be sent encrypted to the POP3 server."
msgstr ""
"បើ​សា​រ​មិនទាន់​អ៊ិនគ្រីប​បានផ្ញើតាម​រយៈអ៊ីធឺណិត​ អត្ថប្រយោជន៍​នៃការប្រើ​ <application>ssh</"
"application> គឺជា​ាពាក្យសម្ងាត់​ <emphasis>របស់អ្នក​</emphasis> នឹង​ផ្ញើសារ​ដែល​បាន​អ៊ិនគ្រីប​ទៅ​"
"ម៉ាស៊ីនបម្រើ  POP ។."

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid "Does &kmail; lock the folders it uses?"
msgstr "តើ​ Kmail ចាក់សោ​​ថត​ដែ​ល​វាប្រើ​ទេ​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:454
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kmail; does not lock the files in <filename class=\"directory\">~/Mail</"
#| "filename>."
msgid ""
"&kmail; does not lock the files in <filename class=\"directory\">~/local/"
"share</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Kmail មិនចាក់សោ​​ឯកសារនៅក្នុង​ថត​ <filename class=\"directory\">~/Mail</filename> "
"ឡើយ ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:456
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To avoid the risk of losing mail <emphasis>if using a local account</"
"emphasis> it is necessary to ensure that &kmail; uses the same type of "
"locking as your mail delivery agent."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​ជៀសវាងគ្រោះថ្នាក់​នៃ​ការបាត់បង់​សំបុត្រ​ <emphasis>បើប្រើ​គណនី​មូល​ដ្ឋាន​ </emphasis> វាចាំបាច់​"
"ក្នុង​ការធានា​ថា​ Kmail ប្រើ​ប្រភេទ​ចាក់សោ​ដូចគ្នា​​ជា​ភ្នាក់ងារ​បញ្ចូន​សំបុត្រ​​របស់អ្នក​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are five different locking options you can use:"
msgstr "មាន​ជម្រើស​ចាក់សោ​៥ប្រភេទ​ដែលអ្នកអាច​ប្រើបាន​ ៖"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: faq.docbook:463
#, no-c-format
msgid "Procmail lockfile"
msgstr "ឯកសារជាប់សោ​ Procmail"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: faq.docbook:464
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mutt dotlock"
msgstr "Mutt dotlock"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: faq.docbook:465
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mutt dotlock privileged"
msgstr "សិទ្ធ Mutt dotlock "

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:466
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>FCNTL</guilabel> (default)"
msgstr "<guilabel>FCNTL</guilabel> (លំនាំដើម​)"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: faq.docbook:467
#, no-c-format
msgid "none (use with care)"
msgstr "គ្មាន​ (ប្រើ​យ៉ាងប្រុងប្រយ័ត្ន​)"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Procmail lockfile</guilabel> will use a small utility that comes "
"with <application>procmail</application> called <command>lockfile</command>. "
"You can use this if your mail folder is in a folder where you have write "
"permission. This will not work on your <filename class=\"directory\">/var/"
"spool/mail/user</filename> file in most cases. It will create <filename>."
"lock</filename> files on your account when &kmail; is checking for new mail. "
"Please note that this will only work if <application>procmail</application> "
"is installed on your system."
msgstr ""
"ឯកសារ​ជាប់សោ<guilabel>Procmail </guilabel> នឹងប្រើឧបករណ៍ប្រើប្រាស់​ដែលភ្ជាប់មក​"
"ជាមួយ<application>procmail</application> ហៅថា​ <command>ឯកសារ​ជាប់សោ​</command>។ "
"អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​វា​ បើ​ថត​សំបុត្រ​របស់អ្នក​ឋិតនៅក្នុងទីតាំង​ដែលអ្នកបានសរសេរ​សិទ្ធឲ្យ​ ។ វិធីនេះនឹង​មិនធ្វើការ​"
"នៅលើ​ឯកសារ​ <filename class=\"directory\">/var/spool/mail/user</filename> "
"របស់អ្នកទេ​ ។ វា​នឹង​បង្កើត​​ឯកសារ​ <filename>.lock</filename> នៅក្នុង​គណនី​របស់អ្នកពេល​ kmail "
"កំពុង​ត្រួតពិនិត្យ​​សំបុត្រ​ថ្មី ។សូម​ចំណាំថា​វា​អាច​ធ្វើ​ការបាន​លុះត្រា​ដំឡើង​ <application>procmail</"
"application> នៅលើ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​របស់អ្នក ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:479
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Mutt dotlock</guilabel> and <guilabel>Mutt dotlock privileged</"
"guilabel> will both use a small utility that comes with <application>mutt</"
"application> called <command>mutt_dotlock</command>. <guilabel>Mutt dotlock</"
"guilabel> can be used in the same way as the <guilabel>Procmail lockfile</"
"guilabel> option, with the same limitation with regards to the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/spool/mail/</filename> folders. However, the "
"<guilabel>Mutt dotlock privileged</guilabel> option can create lock files in "
"the <filename class=\"directory\">/var/spool/mail</filename> folder. "
"<command>mutt_dotlock</command> is a setgid program and this option will run "
"it in setgid mode. Please note that these options will only work if "
"<application>mutt</application> is installed on your system."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Mutt dotlock</guilabel> និង <guilabel>Mutt dotlock ដែល​មាន​សិទ្ធិ</"
"guilabel> នឹង​ប្រើ​ឧបករណ៍​ប្រើប្រាស់​តូច​ដែល​មក​ជាមួយ <application>mutt</application> ដែល​ហៅ​"
"ថា <command>mutt_dotlock</command>. <guilabel>Mutt dotlock</guilabel> អាច​ត្រូវ​"
"បាន​ប្រើ​ក្នុង​វិធី​តែ​មួយ​ដូច​ជម្រើស <guilabel>Procmail lockfile</guilabel> ដែល​មាន​ការ​កំណត់​ដូច​"
"គ្នា​ដោយ​គោរព​តាម​ថត <filename class=\"directory\">/var/spool/mail/</filename> ។ "
"ទោះ​បី​យ៉ាង​ណា​ជម្រើស <guilabel>Mutt dotlock ដែល​មាន​សិទ្ធិ</guilabel> អាច​បង្កើត​ឯកសារ​ចាក់សោ​"
"ក្នុង​ថត <filename class=\"directory\">/var/spool/mail</filename> ។ "
"<command>mutt_dotlock</command> គឺ​ជា​កម្មវិធី setgid និង​ជម្រើស​នេះ​នឹង​រត់​វា​ក្នុង​របៀប "
"setgid ។ សូម​ចំណាំ​ថា ជម្រើស​ទាំងនេះ​នឹង​ធ្វើ​ការ​តែ​បើ <application>mutt</application> ត្រូវ​"
"បាន​ដំឡើង​លើ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​របស់​អ្នក ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:492
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>FCNTL</guilabel> will use the <function>fcntl()</function> system "
"call."
msgstr "<guilabel>FCNTL</guilabel> នឹងប្រើប្រព័ន្ធហៅ​<function>fcntl()</function> ​។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Usage of FCNTL locking might cause system lockups when the mail spool file "
"is on an NFS mounted device."
msgstr ""
"ការ​ប្រើប្រាស់​នៃ FCNTL ដែល​ចាក់សោ​អាច​បង្ករ​ឲ្យ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​រក​មើល ពេល​ឯកសារ​ស្ពូល​សំបុត្រ​នៅ​លើ​ឧបករណ៍​ដែល​បាន​"
"ម៉ោន NFS ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:498
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do not want to use any locking, the <guilabel>none</guilabel> option "
"is what you want. However, there are risks of losing mail when no locking is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​មិន​ចង់​ប្រើ​ការ​ចាក់សោ​ណាមួយ <guilabel>គ្មាន</guilabel> ជម្រើស​គឺ​ជា​អ្វី​ដែល​អ្នក​ត្រូវការ ។ "
"ទោះ​យ៉ាង​ណា មាន​គ្រោះថ្នាក់​នៃ​ការ​បាត់បង់​សំបុត្រ ពេល​មិន​បាន​ចាក់សោ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:506
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "How do I leave messages on the server?"
msgid "How do I leave messages on the POP3 server?"
msgstr "តើ​ខ្ញុំ​ត្រូវ​ចេញ​ពី​សារ​នៅលើ​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ​នេះ​បាន​យ៉ាងដូចម្តេច​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:508
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "See the <link linkend=\"popfilters\">Download filters</link> chapter. If "
#| "you want to leave all messages on the server: open up the "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kmail;...</"
#| "guimenuitem> </menuchoice> window. Click on the <guilabel>Network</"
#| "guilabel> page. Select your account from the account list and click the "
#| "<guibutton>Modify...</guibutton> button. This dialog contains the "
#| "<guilabel>Leave fetched messages on the server</guilabel> setting which "
#| "you must enable."
msgid ""
"If you want to leave all messages on the server: open up the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kmail;...</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> window. Click on the <guilabel>Accounts</"
"guilabel> page. Select your account from the account list and click the "
"<guibutton>Modify...</guibutton> button. This dialog contains the "
"<guilabel>Leave fetched messages on the server</guilabel> setting which you "
"must enable."
msgstr ""
"សូម​មើល​ជំពូក​ <link linkend=\"popfilters\">ទាញយក​តម្រង​</link> ។ បើ​អ្នក​ចង់​ចាកចេញ​ពី​"
"សារទាំងអស់​នៅលើ​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ​​ ៖ បើក​បង្អួច​<menuchoice><guimenu>ការកំណត់​</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>កំណត់​រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​ Kmail...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ។ ចុច​លើ​"
"ទំព័រ​<guilabel>បណ្តាញ​</guilabel> ។ ជ្រើស​គណនី​របស់អ្នក​ពី​បញ្ជី​គណនី​ ហើយ​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​"
"<guibutton>កែប្រែ...</guibutton> ។ ប្រអប់​នេះ​បានចាកចេញ​ទៅ​ប្រមូល​យក​សារ​នៅ​លើ​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ​​ "
"<guilabel></guilabel> ការកំណត់​ដែលអ្នក​បានអនុញ្ញាត​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:517
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I automatically insert a text footer within my messages?"
msgstr "តើ​ខ្ញុំ​ត្រូវ​បញ្ចូលបាតកថាអត្ថបទ​ក្នុង​សារ​របស់ខ្ញុំ​បាន​យ៉ាង​ដូច​ម្តេច​ដែរ​ ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:519
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The text footer is also called a signature (not to be confused with a "
#| "cryptographic signature). Select <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
#| "<guimenuitem>Configure &kmail;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> Look in the "
#| "<guilabel>Identity</guilabel> page for the <guilabel>Signature</guilabel> "
#| "tab and add your signature there. Then go to the <guilabel>General</"
#| "guilabel> tab on the <guilabel>Composer</guilabel> page and enable"
msgid ""
"The text footer is also called a signature (not to be confused with a "
"cryptographic signature). Select <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &kmail;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Look in the "
"<guilabel>Identity</guilabel> page for the <guilabel>Signature</guilabel> "
"tab and add your signature there. Then go to the <guilabel>General</"
"guilabel> tab on the <guilabel>Composer</guilabel> page and enable <xref "
"linkend=\"configure-composer-general-append-signature\"/>"
msgstr ""
"បាតកថាអត្ថបទ​ក៏​អាច​ហៅ​ថា​ហត្ថលេខា​បាន​ដែរ (សូម​កុំច្រឡំ​ជា​មួយ​ការចុះហត្ថលេខាក្រាហ្វិក​អក្សរសម្ងាត់​​) ។ "
"ជ្រើស​ <menuchoice><guimenu>ការកំណត់​</guimenu> <guimenuitem>កំណត់​រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​ Kmail..."
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice> មើល​ក្នុង​ទំព័រ​ <guilabel>អត្ថសញ្ញាណ​</guilabel> ចំពោះផ្ទាំង​ "
"<guilabel>ចុះហត្ថលេខា​</guilabel> ហើយ​បន្ថែម​ការចុះហត្ថលេខា​នៅទីនេះ ។ បន្ទាប់មកត្រឡប់ទៅ​"
"ផ្ទាំង <guilabel>ទូទៅ​</guilabel> នៅលើ​ទំព័រ​<guilabel>កម្មវិធីតែង​</guilabel> "

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:530
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How do I set up &Sendmail; to work with &kmail; if I have a dial-up "
"connection?"
msgstr ""
"តើ​ខ្ញុំ​ត្រូវ​រៀបចំ​ Sendmail ឲ្យ​ធ្វើការ​ជាមួយ Kmail យ៉ាងដូច​ម្តេច​បើ​​ខ្ញុំ​បានតភ្ជាប់​តាម​ខ្សែទូរស័ព្ទ​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:533
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First you should check if your distribution can do this for you. It probably "
"has already been set up during installation."
msgstr ""
"ជាដំបូង​អ្នក​គួរតែ​ពិនិត្យ​បើ​ការចែកចាយ​របស់អ្នក​អាច​ធ្វើ​បែប​នេះ​បាន ។ វា​ប្រហែល​ជា​បាន​រៀបចំ​​រួចរាល់ ​ហើយ​"
"កំឡុង​ពេល​ការដំឡើង​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:537
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If that is not the case, you may want to have a look at <ulink url="
#| "\"http://en.tldp.org/HOWTO/mini/Mail-Queue.html\">the Mail Queue HOWTO</"
#| "ulink>."
msgid ""
"If that is not the case, you may want to have a look at <ulink url=\"http://"
"tldp.org/HOWTO/Mail-Queue.html\">the Mail Queue HOWTO</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"បើ​មិនមែន​ករណីនេះ អ្ន​ក​អាច​មើល​ <ulink url=\"http://en.tldp.org/HOWTO/mini/Mail-"
"Queue.html\"> Mail Queue HOWTO</ulink> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I've seen demonstrations of remote control behavior with &kmail;. Is there "
"any documentation on the available interfaces?"
msgstr ""
"ខ្ញុំ​បានបង្ហាញ​ឥរិយាបទការ​បញ្ជា​ពី​ចម្ងាយ​សាកមើល​​ជាមួយ Kmail ។ តើ​មាន​ឯកសារ​ណាខ្លះ​​ដែលអាច​ប្រើ​ចំណុច​"
"ប្រទាក់នេះ​បាន​?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:545
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can get a list of functions by using this command in a shell: "
#| "<userinput><command>dcop</command> <option>kmail KMailIface</option></"
#| "userinput>. Some documentation is also available in <filename>kdenetwork/"
#| "kmail/kmailIface.h</filename> and <filename>kdenetwork/kmail/"
#| "mailcomposerIface.h</filename>."
msgid ""
"You can get a list of functions by using this command in a shell: "
"<userinput><command>qdbus</command> <option>org.kde.kmail /KMail</option></"
"userinput>. Then you can control &kmail; like this: "
"<userinput><command>qdbus</command> <option>org.kde.kmail /KMail org.kde."
"kmail.kmail.folderList</option></userinput>. You can use "
"<application>qdbusviewer</application> to browse available methods in a "
"graphical interface."
msgstr ""
"អ្នកទទួល​បាន​បញ្ជី​មុខងារ​ដោយ​ប្រើ​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​នេះ​នៅក្នុង​សែល​ ៖ <userinput><command>dcop</"
"command> <option>kmail KMailIface</option></userinput>។ ឯកសារ​មួយ​ចំនួន​​ក៏អាច​ប្រើបាន​"
"នៅក្នុង​ <filename>kdenetwork/kmail/kmailIface.h</filename> និង​ "
"<filename>kdenetwork/kmail/mailcomposerIface.h</filename> ផងដែរ​ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:552
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When I reply to a message, only a part of the message is quoted. How come?"
msgstr "ពេល​ខ្ញុំ​ឆ្លើយ​តប​សារ​ មានតែ​ផ្នែក​មួយ​នៃ​សារ​ត្រូវ​បានដកស្រង់​ តើ​វា​បាន​មក​ដោយ​របៀប​ណា?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:553
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This can happen when the message contains two dashes and a space on a "
#| "single line. This is seen as the start of the signature. The remaining "
#| "part of the message will not be quoted, because when you reply to a "
#| "message KMail strips the signature."
msgid ""
"This can happen when the message contains two dashes and a space on a single "
"line. This is seen as the start of the signature. The remaining part of the "
"message will not be quoted, because when you reply to a message &kmail; "
"strips the signature."
msgstr ""
"ករណី​នេះអាច​កើតឡើង​ពេលសារ​មាន​បន្ទាប់ដាច់ៗ​ពី និង​ចន្លោះ​មើល​មិន​ឃើញ​ចំនួន​មួយ។ នេះ​ជាការ​ចាប់ផ្តើម​"
"ចុះហត្ថលេខា​ ។ ផ្នែក​ដែល​នៅ​សល់​របសសារ​នឹង​មិនដកស្រង់​ទេ ព្រោះ​ពេលអ្នក ឆ្លើយ​តប​សារ​ KMail ច្រូត​"
"ការចុះហត្ថលេខា​ចេញ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:558
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I am only using &imap;, can I get rid of those Local Folders in the folder "
"list or at least keep them collapsed all the time?"
msgstr ""
"ខ្ញុំ​ប្រើតែ​ imap តើ​ខ្ញុំ​អាច​កម្ចាត់​ថតមូលដ្ឋាន​នៅក្នុង​បញ្ជី​ថត​ ឬ​រក្សាពួក​វាគ្រប់ពេល​ដែលវេញបាន​ដែរឬទេ​ ?"

#. Tag: para
#: faq.docbook:560
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "No you can not get rid of them. The local folders function as a fallback "
#| "when the &imap; server is unreachable. Although you only use &imap;, "
#| "&kmail; uses the outbox for sending the messages. If we hide all local "
#| "folders you won't be able to fix messages in the outbox which can not be "
#| "send for some reason. But it is possible to keep the local folders "
#| "collapsed. What you have to do is go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
#| "guimenu><guimenuitem> Configure &kmail;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and "
#| "go to the section Misc, there you can setup the folder on startup. If you "
#| "change that to a folder on the &imap; account, the Local Folders will "
#| "stay collapsed when &kmail; starts."
msgid ""
"No, you cannot get rid of them. The local folders function as a fallback "
"when the &imap; server is unreachable. Although you only use &imap;, &kmail; "
"uses the outbox for sending the messages. If we hide all local folders you "
"will not be able to fix messages in the outbox which cannot be send for some "
"reason. But it is possible to keep the local folders collapsed. What you "
"have to do is go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem> "
"Configure &kmail;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and go to the section Misc, "
"there you can setup the folder on startup. If you change that to a folder on "
"the &imap; account, the Local Folders will stay collapsed when &kmail; "
"starts."
msgstr ""
"ទេ​ អ្នកមិន​អាច​កម្ចាត់​ពួក​វា​បានឡើយ ។ មុខងារថត​មូលដ្ឋាន​​ជា​ fallback ពេល​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ​imap មិនអាច​"
"ទៅដល់​ ។ អ្នក​បាន​តែ​ប្រើ​ imap kmail ប្រើ​ប្រអប់ចេញសម្រាប់​ការផ្ញើសារ​ ។ បើ​យើង​លាក់​ថត​មូលដ្ឋាន​"
"អ្នកនឹង​មិនអាច​ជួសជុល​សារ​នៅក្នុង​ប្រអប់ចេញ​ ដែល​មិនអាច​ផ្ញើចេញ​បានឡើយ​ ។ ប៉ុន្តែ​វា​អាច​រក្សា​ថត​មូលដ្ឋាន​​"
"ដែលបាន​វេញ​ទុក​ ។ តើអ្នកបានធ្វើអ្វី​ទៅកាន់​ <menuchoice><guimenu>ការកំណត់​</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem> កំណត់​រចនាមស្ព័ន្ធ​ kmail...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"ហើយត្រឡប់ទៅ​ភាគ​ Misc វិញ​អ្នកអាច​រៀបចំ​ថត​ពេលចាប់ផ្តើម​ ។ បើ​អ្នកផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​វា​ទៅ​ថត​នៅលើ​គណនី imap​ "
"ថត​មូល​ដ្ឋាន​​នឹង​នៅ​តែ​បាន​វិញ​ពេល​ Kmail ចាប់ផ្តើម​ ។​"

